    "group": "Forgefather's Seekers",
    "summary": "You may call Devastator Doctrine once more over the battle. Friendly Adeptus Astartes ranged attacks gain 1 Strength against targets no farther than 12 inches away. Fielding Vulkan He’stan lets your Infernus Squad units start an action even if selected to Fall Back or to Advance. Starting one of these actions also leaves them eligible to shoot. Salamanders are allowed, with other chapter-specific Adeptus Astartes excluded.",
